# Local desk configuration (gitignored when copied to AGENTS.local.md)

Copy this file to `AGENTS.local.md` and fill in desk-specific values.
Never commit `AGENTS.local.md`.

```
AWS_ACCOUNT_ID=
AWS_REGION=us-east-1
ROUTE53_HOSTED_ZONE_ID=
AMPLIFY_APP_ID=
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET_ARN=
AURITUS_DAILY_BUDGET_USD=50
AURITUS_CLAIM_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=900
```
